file construction/ITINERARY.md the live front, and the git nib
recommend keep-going -- twenty-eight doors now stand named rather than counted, each one its own lane's hand, and the next agent-doable lap in this lane is the lane's own second door rather than a sweep from here. Worth Keaton's word on whether eight round-open stashes holding nothing lost may be dropped, since a drop is a removal and no lap takes one unasked.
